# {{project}}

Session tracking for {{project}}.

A session records lastSeen, a timestamp in milliseconds (Date.now()). A session goes idle 30 minutes after lastSeen. All durations in this package are milliseconds.

files.src/session.js:
function touch(session, now) {
  session.lastSeen = now;
  return session;
}

module.exports = { touch };

files.test/session.test.js:
